{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get video session"},"description":"Freebeat videos are made by a director agent that works in stages, as on freebeat.ai, where a person chats with it and sees what it made. In auto mode it makes the creative decisions and delivers the film; otherwise it pauses for the person's input where taste matters. get_video_session shows its words, stage statuses and work; send_video_agent_message passes on the person's feedback, approval or direction, or hands the rest to auto. Work that follows a message is charged per stage like the rest of the session. Read an existing song-driven video session: recent conversation and requests, running or waiting state, pipeline statuses, auto setting, and readable artifacts with viewable or playable media URLs. fields contain labeled display values, media contains their URLs: plain web links that open in a browser. ChatGPT drops inline images from these hosts, so a person sees them only as links. Results are bounded; truncated means some content was shortened or omitted. This read does not start work or final rendering.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"task_id":{"description":"The task_id from generate_music_video, generate_dance_video, or generate_lyric_video.","maxLength":500,"pattern":"^(music_video|dance|lyric_video):.+","type":"string"}},"required":["task_id"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_video_session","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"description":"On success, returns the tool result fields. On error, returns success:false, error and code, with optional credit approval details; success-only fields are absent.","properties":{"artifacts":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"fields":{"$ref":"#/properties/waiting_for/items/prop